            },
            "outputSchema": "",
            "structuredContent": {}
          },
          "name": "get_sensor_readings_flow",
          "description": "Get the last 24 hours of sensor readings for one asset in the operator's region, oldest first (one reading every 4 hours): reading time, vibration (g RMS), temperature (F), pressure (psi), flow (bbl/h), power (kW). Use it to describe a trend. NOT_FOUND = not in your region.",
