          "name": "get_alerts_flow",
          "description": "List alerts in the operator's region (open or acknowledged, plus the last 30 days): alert_id, asset, severity (WARNING, CRITICAL), failure mode, message, status (OPEN, ACKNOWLEDGED, CLOSED), when and by whom (monitoring system or control room). asset_id = ALL (or empty) or one asset.",
          "schemas": {
