          "name": "get_failure_history_flow",
          "description": "Get Mesa Ridge's reliability library for the asset's type: closed work orders across all basins from the last 2 years with wo_number, past asset, basin, closed date, failure mode, the symptom as written, the fix applied, parts used and downtime. Equipment data only (no people) - pass the rows to similar_failure_agent as they are.",
          "schemas": {
