        {
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "open_service_case",
            "handlerDescription": "Hand a request that a person must decide to the right team. request_type is shut_in (shut-in or emergency shutdown of an asset), safety_signal (gas odor, H2S, a spill, fire or an injury reported directly - a field note with safety language is routed by log_field_note instead), threshold_change (changing a sensor threshold) or alert_closure (closing the asset's open alert). summary is a neutral 1-3 sentence summary in the operator's own words; agent_brief is an agent's output if relevant, else empty. The system routes it and returns OPENED with case_id, team and reply time, EXISTING, or BLOCKED / INVALID_TYPE with a reason. The assistant never shuts in, restarts or clears anything itself and never promises or predicts the outcome. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
            "toolTitle": "",
            "readOnlyToolHint": false,
            "destructiveToolHint": false,
