        "name": "verify_operator_flow",
        "description": "Verify a Mesa Ridge control-room operator with their staff ID (MRE-4101, mre4101 or 4101 all work) and their one-time code. Returns VERIFIED with a session_token (valid 60 minutes), their name, their region and their work-order limit, VERIFY_FAILED, or LOCKED after too many failed attempts. Call this before any operator tool. Never reveal, guess or hint at codes. Production Engineering supervisors and HSE reviewers use verify_reviewer instead. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
