    {
      "id": "flow:confirm_action_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "confirm_action_flow",
        "description": "Step 2 of 2: carry out a work order the operator has explicitly confirmed. Pass the proposal_id from propose_work_order. The system re-checks every rule and returns EXECUTED with the work_order number (e.g. MRE-WO-1101), SUPERVISOR_APPROVAL with a case_id (estimate above the operator&#39;s limit: nothing is created until a Production Engineering supervisor approves), or BLOCKED / EXPIRED (after 15 minutes) / NOT_FOUND / ALREADY_DONE with the reason. Only call after the operator says yes to the exact proposal. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": 1,
