        "name": "log_alert_flow",
        "description": "Log an alert for an asset in your region. The severity, failure mode and message come from the sensor classification, not from you. Returns LOGGED with the alert_id, ALREADY_LOGGED_TODAY (one alert per asset per day - the existing alert is shown), HEALTH_NORMAL (no alert for a NORMAL asset) or NOT_FOUND. Closing an alert is a Production Engineering decision (open_service_case alert_closure). Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
